{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 29,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 289.143,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, there shall be many\u2014",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.456,
      "end": 6.496,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at that day when I shall proceed to do a marvelous work among them,",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.676,
      "end": 11.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may remember my covenants which I have made unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.918,
      "end": 14.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may set my hand again the second time",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.07,
      "end": 18.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to recover my people, which are of the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "29:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.605,
      "end": 22.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also, that I may remember the promises",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 22.664,
      "end": 25.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I have made unto thee, Nephi,",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 25.259,
      "end": 27.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also unto thy father,",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 27.436,
      "end": 29.665,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I would remember your seed;",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 29.845,
      "end": 35.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that the words of your seed should proceed forth out of my mouth unto your seed;",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 35.551,
      "end": 39.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my words shall hiss forth unto the ends of the earth,",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.864,
      "end": 42.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for a standard unto my people,",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.598,
      "end": 45.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are of the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "29:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 45.693,
      "end": 48.061,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because my words shall hiss forth\u2014",
      "verse": "29:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 48.241,
      "end": 50.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many of the Gentiles shall say:",
      "verse": "29:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 50.557,
      "end": 52.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "A Bible! A Bible!",
      "verse": "29:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 52.595,
      "end": 54.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We have got a Bible,",
      "verse": "29:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 54.308,
      "end": 56.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there cannot be any more Bible.",
      "verse": "29:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 57.078,
      "end": 58.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But thus saith the Lord God:",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 59.069,
      "end": 60.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O fools,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 60.271,
      "end": 61.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall have a Bible;",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 62.03,
      "end": 64.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall proceed forth from the Jews,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 64.764,
      "end": 66.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "mine ancient covenant people.",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 66.987,
      "end": 68.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And what thank they the Jews",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 69.025,
      "end": 71.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Bible which they receive from them?",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 71.666,
      "end": 73.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, what do the Gentiles mean?",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 73.518,
      "end": 75.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do they remember the travails,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 75.648,
      "end": 77.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the labors,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 77.268,
      "end": 79.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the pains of the Jews,",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 79.259,
      "end": 83.949,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their diligence unto me, in bringing forth salvation unto the Gentiles?",
      "verse": "29:4",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 84.629,
      "end": 86.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O ye Gentiles,",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 86.202,
      "end": 88.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have ye remembered the Jews,",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 88.379,
      "end": 90.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "mine ancient covenant people?",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 90.277,
      "end": 92.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay; but ye have cursed them,",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 92.825,
      "end": 94.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have hated them,",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 94.491,
      "end": 96.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have not sought to recover them.",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 96.9,
      "end": 100.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I will return all these things upon your own heads;",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 101.167,
      "end": 103.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I the Lord have not forgotten my people.",
      "verse": "29:5",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 104.448,
      "end": 106.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou fool, that shall say:",
      "verse": "29:6",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 106.578,
      "end": 108.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "A Bible, we have got a Bible,",
      "verse": "29:6",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 108.755,
      "end": 110.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we need no more Bible.",
      "verse": "29:6",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 110.607,
      "end": 113.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Have ye obtained a Bible save it were by the Jews?",
      "verse": "29:6",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 114.306,
      "end": 116.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Know ye not that there are more nations than one?",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 116.994,
      "end": 118.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Know ye not that I,",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 118.707,
      "end": 120.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord your God,",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 120.234,
      "end": 121.859,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have created all men,",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 122.039,
      "end": 125.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I remember those who are upon the isles of the sea;",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 126.074,
      "end": 128.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I rule in the heavens above",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 128.669,
      "end": 130.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the earth beneath;",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 130.66,
      "end": 133.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I bring forth my word unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 133.951,
      "end": 136.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even upon all the nations of the earth?",
      "verse": "29:7",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 137.278,
      "end": 138.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore murmur ye,",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 139.13,
      "end": 141.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because that ye shall receive more of my word?",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 142.096,
      "end": 145.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Know ye not that the testimony of two nations",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 145.248,
      "end": 147.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is a witness unto you that I am God,",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 147.936,
      "end": 150.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I remember one nation like unto another?",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 150.949,
      "end": 155.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I speak the same words unto one nation like unto another.",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 155.773,
      "end": 158.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the two nations shall run together",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 158.461,
      "end": 162.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the testimony of the two nations shall run together also.",
      "verse": "29:8",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 162.717,
      "end": 165.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I do this that I may prove unto many",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 165.683,
      "end": 169.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I am the same yesterday, today, and forever;",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 169.3,
      "end": 172.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I speak forth my words according to mine own pleasure.",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 173.102,
      "end": 175.563,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And because that I have spoken one word",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 175.743,
      "end": 178.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye need not suppose that I cannot speak another;",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 178.617,
      "end": 180.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for my work is not yet finished;",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 181.026,
      "end": 183.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall it be until the end of man,",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 183.76,
      "end": 186.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither from that time henceforth and forever.",
      "verse": "29:9",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 186.994,
      "end": 189.316,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, because that ye have a Bible",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 189.496,
      "end": 192.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye need not suppose that it contains all my words;",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 192.834,
      "end": 196.178,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither need ye suppose that I have not caused more to be written.",
      "verse": "29:10",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 196.858,
      "end": 198.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I command all men,",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 198.71,
      "end": 201.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both in the east and in the west,",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 201.491,
      "end": 203.859,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the north, and in the south,",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 204.039,
      "end": 205.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the islands of the sea,",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 206.123,
      "end": 209.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they shall write the words which I speak unto them;",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 209.74,
      "end": 212.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for out of the books which shall be written",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 212.614,
      "end": 214.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will judge the world,",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 214.466,
      "end": 218.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every man according to their works, according to that which is written.",
      "verse": "29:11",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 219.465,
      "end": 221.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, I shall speak unto the Jews",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 222.153,
      "end": 223.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall write it;",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 224.051,
      "end": 226.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I shall also speak unto the Nephites",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 226.971,
      "end": 228.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall write it;",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 228.869,
      "end": 233.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I shall also speak unto the other tribes of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 233.461,
      "end": 235.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I have led away,",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 235.452,
      "end": 237.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall write it;",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 237.35,
      "end": 240.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I shall also speak unto all nations of the earth",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 241.106,
      "end": 242.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall write it.",
      "verse": "29:12",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 243.551,
      "end": 248.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that the Jews shall have the words of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 248.236,
      "end": 251.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Nephites shall have the words of the Jews;",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 251.713,
      "end": 256.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Nephites and the Jews shall have the words of the lost tribes of Israel;",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 256.583,
      "end": 262.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the lost tribes of Israel shall have the words of the Nephites and the Jews.",
      "verse": "29:13",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 262.929,
      "end": 268.037,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that my people, which are of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 268.217,
      "end": 271.839,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be gathered home unto the lands of their possessions;",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 272.019,
      "end": 274.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my word also shall be gathered in one.",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 274.939,
      "end": 278.097,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will show unto them that fight against my word",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 278.277,
      "end": 279.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and against my people,",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 279.943,
      "end": 282.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who are of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 282.631,
      "end": 283.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I am God,",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 284.158,
      "end": 288.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I covenanted with Abraham that I would remember his seed forever.",
      "verse": "29:14",
      "lineIndex": 100
    }
  ]
}